    "rating": 3.6,
    "reference": "ChIJf6HRY0dIyUwRPAdW1ZQYPQg",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Katie Momo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101166592891723970204/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2SHsdtmdfpTyiRD3EoqqRkW4o2rlUShm5dklxedJqaAcHKEM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Great service! The whole staff was super helpful and friendly.\n\nWe ordered the privacy slats for our chain-link fence and they were very helpful with explaining how to install them.\n\nWe needed the slats to get our pool permit.\n\nThe quality is much better than the slats that we tried from Reno Depot and the price is similar. Also MUCH easier to install on our fence!\n\nLove how it turned out!",
        "time": 1649866837,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "littledippyslice",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109932916619745213296/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLZy2TyzLYCunVRy8UFT3CrrvDd8HkkKxk6Nfx6a3Mtg40HQL0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Service was excellent! The office staff was so easy to deal with. Linda and sylvie both understood that we had a time frame for a couple of different things we needed done and they got us in as fast as possible. All the guys doing the work were super nice! Super knowledgeable! Needless to say our pooch has a fully fenced yard now and she can play all day! Thank you for great service!",
        "time": 1749325177,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Laddi Woolhouse",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116116079851046581869/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWbKP2qlT3OUYO5DA8ZPcFqxUAoJcJNaKM_MEpOl0AxoEhV6VAk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I had excellent service from closure jemar. Chris the salesperson was very helpful and professional and always responded quickly to my inquiries. The men who did the installation were great-friendly and polite and the installation looks perfect. Linda in the office was polite courteous and always followed through with the timeline. I would definitely recommend them",
        "time": 1700081490,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Brandon Hum",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104297757011089460763/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJGsd9ZOflMXXE8NqkRzES2qTpERUsdV0eJ-qP4hIyDEcR8-g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "As others have mentioned, the workers doing the installation were excellent and very friendly, but the management was a complete disaster.  I contacted them in April and made it clear that we needed our fence done by the end of the summer, and even chose them over another company we had a cheaper quote from because they said they could do it earlier by July, or August at the latest.  Ended up being done in December, and was told at the last minute that I would need to install the slats myself even though the installation was included in the original contract.\n\nMy wife gave birth in October which is why we really wanted the fence to be taken care of earlier, and every attempt to ask for updates since June was met with vague answers that our project would be taken care of \"soon\" or in \"the next few weeks\".  We even had access to a third party that could have handled the installation in October so I suggested Jermar could perhaps just deliver the materials and leave out the labor, but was again told not to worry and that they would be able to complete it by the end of the month.  So we took down our hedges in preparation, leaving our yard completely open for nearly 3 months which was extremely problematic for us for a number of reasons.  Do not believe in their disclaimer of valuing your privacy and security, that was clearly not the case for us.\n\nNow I'm in the process of slowly installing the slats, which is hours and hours spent that I could instead have been spending with my newborn, and requested if I could at least delay my final payment until I was done with that to make sure everything was in order, but they couldn't even afford me that small convenience.\n\nComplete nightmare of an experience from start to finish, and would never recommend this company to anyone.  I understand the delays due to COVID and staffing issues, but they could have been more transparent instead of setting up unreasonable expectations every step of the way.  Horrible management and administration, avoid unless you want to deal with nearly a year of frustration from a company who has little to no care for its customers.",
        "time": 1639503949,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Steve R",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114653399694767947188/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKF6dOwPbWntZUJxcW-CI5rW4Xrzb4U5AbrS3-fNBsrlhktPA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Took over two weeks  to respond, and when they did, wanted to charge me $1000 for approximately an hour of labour, no parts.\nThis was to rehang one 8 foot section of metal fencing. Two horizontal pieces and 6 vertical sections and 4 bolts. No cutting , no digging. Posts were already in place.\nAre you kidding me  $1000?\nNO THANKS !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!",
        "time": 1733176151,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
